                <mxCell id="n3" value="&lt;b&gt;Tool Design Patterns&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• All tools return structured dicts instead of raising exceptions&lt;br&gt;• Search tools use a 30 s timeout with keyword fallback&lt;br&gt;• Entity network traversal spans 1-3 hops with score decay&lt;br&gt;• Highlight tools emit clip timestamps for the frontend&lt;br&gt;• Dynamic selection reduces latency and token usage" style="shape=note;size=15;fillColor=#FFFFCC;strokeColor=#B3B300;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=4;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=4;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;shadow=1;" parent="1" vertex="1">
