                <mxCell id="n6" value="&lt;b&gt;Streaming Architecture&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Token-by-token delivery over SSE (Server-Sent Events)&lt;br&gt;• The frontend progressively renders the answer with React 19&lt;br&gt;• Navigation actions can jump to timestamps in the player&lt;br&gt;• Source citations can point to frames, scenes, and chapters&lt;br&gt;• The client also supports non-streaming response delivery when needed" style="shape=note;size=15;fillColor=#FFFFCC;strokeColor=#B3B300;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=4;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=4;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;shadow=1;" parent="1" vertex="1">
