                <mxCell id="n1" value="&lt;b&gt;Context Injection Pattern&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Video metadata is injected as an invisible prefix on the user message&lt;br&gt;• QPrismaStateConverter parses the prefix and extracts media_id, user_id, and session_id&lt;br&gt;• The prefix is removed before the model sees the prompt&lt;br&gt;• OpenTelemetry trace context is propagated end to end" style="shape=note;size=15;fillColor=#FFFFCC;strokeColor=#B3B300;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=4;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=4;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;shadow=1;" parent="1" vertex="1">
